                <pb facs="0770" n="668" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg668"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 847/141.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Chargé Weitzel</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-10-03"><hi rendition="#italic">October 3,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The President is sending a congratulatory message to President Obaldia. You will
                    convey to new minister for foreign affairs sincere <pb facs="0771" n="669"
                        xml:id="pg669"/> congratulations and wishes for the development and
                    reenforcement of the necessarily intimate ties that join Panama and the United
                    States and the perpetuation of sincere friendship between them.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
